WEBVTT

NOTE
The Deling City parade gateway — the magic spectacle and gate mechanism.
Duration: approximately 55 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The camera moves through an underground sewer passage, emerging onto a city street.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.880
Irvine and Squall stand among the crowd as the camera continues to rise, revealing fireworks lighting up the sky.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.050
The parade dancers, dressed in cyber-samurai uniforms, continue performing kata as the gates open.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.050
The gates open, revealing powerful magical machinery 

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:23.000
The camera continues to move upward, revealing more of the magical throne.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Finally, the camera reveals Sorceress Edea seated on a throne, flanked by two magical fires and an enormous magical machine.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The camera moves back down to ground level as the parade dancers continue moving forward in kata-like stances in front of the magical throne.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:47.000
A high-angle view of the Deling City parade, with two ornate cauldrons blasting tall orange flames as crowds cheer behind silver barricades

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The crowds continue cheering as fireworks continue to erupt overhead.